#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:5
#: 6f4db389451b406da36e211313b99cd9
msgid "Archived: Traditional Helicopter – Tuning with Copter 3.3 and earlier"
msgstr "已归档：传统直升机——使用 Copter 3.3 及更早版本的调参方法"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:8
#: 212d709e83f447c19c726ef5b4357f59
msgid "PID Tuning"
msgstr "PID 调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:10
#: 38972caa62d44404994b2827c313be1a
msgid ""
"Now, we come to the PID tuning. This part is a bit trickier. The first tip "
"is that whenever you go into the Copter PID configuration screen; make sure "
"that Lock Pitch/Roll is unchecked. Helis need separate pitch/roll values "
"because the moment of inertia of the airframe is very different in the two "
"different axes. This is because the tail boom is so long and there's a lot "
"more mass in the fore/aft axis, so it's slower."
msgstr ""
"现在进入 PID 调参阶段，这部分稍微复杂一些。第一个建议是：每当进入 Copter PID 配置界面时，确保取消勾选\"Lock "
"Pitch/Roll\"。直升机需要单独的俯仰/横滚值，因为机架在两个不同轴上的转动惯量差异很大。这是因为尾梁很长，前后轴方向的质量分布更多，因此响应更慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:17
#: eb7043bc26e64087b5f7f6cad93ae11a
msgid ""
"On the Copter Config tab, the STB_RLL_P value should be the default of 4.5 "
"and STB_PIT_P value should be the default value of 3.5. This softens the "
"pitch axis a bit compared to the roll axis and helps prevent bouncing. The "
"I-term on both should be zero."
msgstr ""
"在 Copter Config 选项卡上，STB_RLL_P 值应为默认值 4.5，STB_PIT_P 值应为默认值 "
"3.5。与横滚轴相比，这使俯仰轴稍微柔和一些，有助于防止弹跳。两者的 I 项均应为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:22
#: a24e81ab325b492ca59366e8784f1e24
msgid "Now, the Rate part is a little trickier."
msgstr "现在，速率部分稍微复杂一些。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:24
#: 3f95b313de994491a5f7e67b459cba87
msgid ""
"You will need to change the RATE_PIT_P and RATE_RLL_P to get your heli to "
"fly properly but to start with, set these to zero. They should be zero by "
"default."
msgstr "您需要调整 RATE_PIT_P 和 RATE_RLL_P 以使直升机正常飞行，但初始时将这两个值设为零。默认情况下它们应该为零。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:28
#: 4c2c13e6de9a4306b8dd60254ee8cd8b
msgid ""
"Something to keep in mind here, the Rate PID numbers you come up with will "
"be heavily influenced by the following: # Your swash servo speed # Your "
"swash servo motion ratio i.e. servo arm length, swash plate dimensions and "
"blade grip arm length # H_PIT_MAX and H_ROL_MAX values."
msgstr ""
"需要注意的是，您得出的速率 PID 数值将在很大程度上受到以下因素的影响：# 倾斜盘舵机速度 # "
"倾斜盘舵机运动比例（即舵机臂长度、倾斜盘尺寸和桨夹臂长度）# H_PIT_MAX 和 H_ROL_MAX 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:34
#: 3d04ae1c33b94713b3a64c3c1309718a
msgid ""
"Any time you change these you'll probably have to retune your Rate PID's a "
"bit. We expect that with faster servos you'll be able to tune Rate P up and "
"get better control without oscillation. Start with RATE_RLL_I of 0.1000 "
"(default) and RATE_PIT_I of 0.0500 (default is 0.1000)."
msgstr ""
"每次更改这些参数时，您可能需要重新调整速率 PID 值。我们预计，使用更快的舵机，您将能够提高速率 P 值并获得更好的控制而不出现振荡。从 "
"RATE_RLL_I 为 0.1000（默认值）和 RATE_PIT_I 为 0.0500（默认值为 0.1000）开始。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:39
#: 53efe2c21f48488784f46c791c820ec0
msgid ""
"Now set Ch6 tuning in the Copter Config tab to CH6_RATE_KP and set the Min "
"to 0.0100 and the Max to 0.0750 and make sure you turn your Ch6 knob all the"
" way down. Refresh parameters and make sure that RATE_PIT_P and RATE_RLL_P "
"show up as 0.0100 so that you know the Ch6 tuning is working properly."
msgstr ""
"现在在 Copter Config 选项卡中将 Ch6 调参设置为 CH6_RATE_KP，最小值设为 0.0100，最大值设为 0.0750，并将 "
"Ch6 旋钮完全旋到最低。刷新参数并确认 RATE_PIT_P 和 RATE_RLL_P 显示为 0.0100，以确认 Ch6 调参正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:45
#: 4de6811975404c12b19cc224b2e9ac78
msgid ""
"Here's where it gets tricky and we really recommend you do this in a large "
"area with no wind. Maybe indoors in a 20m by 20m area, but only if you're a "
"good pilot."
msgstr "这里开始变得棘手，我们强烈建议在无风的宽阔区域进行操作。也许可以在 20m×20m 的室内进行，但仅限于操控技术良好的飞手。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:49
#: 13809a9263d74517976320805f0f9e92
msgid ""
"Spool up your heli **VERY CAREFULLY**. Don't just take off because you will "
"have very little control over the heli! It might be best to do this with "
"training gear if you can. Lift off just one inch but be ready to put it down"
" because you will have little or no control. It's going to be bad, so be "
"ready for it! You should have no oscillation with a P-term of 0.0100."
msgstr ""
"**非常小心地**启动直升机旋翼。不要直接起飞，因为您对直升机的控制将非常有限！如果可能的话，最好使用训练支架进行练习。离地仅约 "
"2.5cm，但要随时准备落地，因为您的控制将很有限甚至没有。情况会很糟糕，请做好心理准备！在 P 项为 0.0100 时，您应该不会出现振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:56
#: b1fb00d302774729a21f247bb0ff4863
msgid ""
"If you do, you have big problems and will need to consult the specialists on"
" DIYDrones!"
msgstr "如果出现振荡，您就遇到大问题了，需要咨询 DIYDrones 上的专家！"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:59
#: 4f1903813d91477a935a17da123fc48f
msgid ""
"Now try turning the knob up a bit, maybe to 0.0200. Try just lifting off "
"remembering that you will still have little control but hopefully you will "
"have no oscillation. Keep doing this, testing more and more P-term until you"
" get oscillation. Be careful with that P-term because once you find the "
"point where it oscillates, it gets bad REALLY fast and you could destroy "
"your helicopter! You will find that the oscillation will always happen in "
"the roll direction first. This is because of its lower moment of inertia."
msgstr ""
"现在尝试将旋钮稍微调高，例如调到 0.0200。尝试仅离地，记住您仍然控制有限，但希望不会出现振荡。继续这样操作，测试越来越高的 P "
"项，直到出现振荡。对 P "
"项要格外小心，因为一旦找到振荡点，情况会**非常迅速**恶化，可能会损毁直升机！您会发现振荡总是首先出现在横滚方向，这是因为横滚轴的转动惯量较小。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:68
#: d1c3e6d8f41248c9929d7dac2d2b084e
msgid ""
"You should get to a RATE_RLL_P of about 0.0400 (on a 450 size heli) or maybe"
" even a little bit more but hopefully you end up in this range. However, you"
" will find that you still have very little control, even up to the point "
"where it starts to oscillate!"
msgstr ""
"对于 450 级直升机，RATE_RLL_P 应能达到约 "
"0.0400，甚至稍高，但希望能落在这个范围内。然而，您会发现即使接近振荡点，您仍然对直升机的控制非常有限！"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:73
#: b06490857b144e578c7555d6dd60ead8
msgid ""
"Once you find the oscillation point, back off a bit, maybe 0.005 to 0.010. "
"Now, set the Ch6 tuning to \"None\", and make sure you have a good Rate "
"P-term in the RATE_RLL_P and RATE_PIT_P window. If you fly right at the "
"limit of oscillation you will find that sometimes if you bump the skids or "
"there's a wind gust, it can start to oscillate. That's why you want to back "
"off a bit."
msgstr ""
"一旦找到振荡点，稍微回调，大约 0.005 到 0.010。现在将 Ch6 调参设置为\"None\"，并确保 RATE_RLL_P 和 "
"RATE_PIT_P 窗口中有良好的速率 P "
"值。如果您在振荡临界点飞行，有时如果踩到了起落架或有一阵风，它可能开始振荡。这就是为什么您需要稍微回调的原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:80
#: 9807fd72d1634987903cbc3c32da3549
msgid ""
"Remember that when you get your P value to high the heli will **rock and "
"roll** something fierce. Be careful and only lift of the ground a few inches"
" or a foot at most and be ready to put it down if it starts to oscillate out"
" of control."
msgstr "请记住，当 P 值过高时，直升机将会**剧烈摇晃**。请小心，仅离地几寸或最多一尺，如果开始失控振荡要随时准备落地。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:85
#: 7d425fc99b0345f186c2734872ed6458
msgid ""
"Now you have established your RATE_RLL_P value, your RATE_PIT_P value can be"
" a little higher. For example, use 0.050 with 0.040 for Roll and remember to"
" unchecked \"Lock Pitch/Roll\"!"
msgstr ""
"现在您已确定 RATE_RLL_P 值，RATE_PIT_P 值可以稍高一点。例如，横滚用 0.040，俯仰用 0.050，并记住要取消勾选\"Lock"
" Pitch/Roll\"！"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:89
#: 0b49c1451b814e289379a72aa3d5b679
msgid ""
"Now you can play with the I-term. You can do so similarly, with Ch6. It’s "
"important to remember the RATE_PIT_I term will be LOWER than the RATE_RLL_I."
" Try using Roll I = 0.250 and Pitch I = 0.150. These I-values are less "
"critical than the P-values - you're not likely to destroy your heli with a "
"high value, more likely to just get a \"bounce\". So, at this point, you "
"should have a heli that will fly without shaking but it still flies like "
"it's “drunk”. It'll just wander around with you chasing it but now it's time"
" to fix that."
msgstr ""
"现在您可以调整 I 项了。同样可以通过 Ch6 进行调整。重要的是要记住，RATE_PIT_I 项将低于 RATE_RLL_I。尝试横滚 I = "
"0.250，俯仰 I = 0.150。这些 I 值不如 P "
"值关键——高值不太可能损毁直升机，更多的是产生\"弹跳\"。所以，到目前为止，您应该有一架可以飞行而不颤抖的直升机，但它飞起来仍像\"喝醉了\"一样，到处游荡需要您追赶，现在是时候解决这个问题了。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:98
#: 764b6684b79e42c1985bf2e7758f07f0
msgid ""
"Go into Advanced Parameters>Parameters List and find RATE_RLL_FF and set it "
"to maybe 0.020 to start. Do the same for RATE_PIT_FF. Write these and then "
"give it a test fly. You should now find that it flies much better, you will "
"have more control, it should hover better. Play with these numbers a bit and"
" always remember to “write” the parameters to the APM. For a 450 size heli "
"try using 0.040 on Roll and 0.050 on Pitch. It’s not clear how high you can "
"push these but it will start to oscillate eventually."
msgstr ""
"进入 Advanced Parameters > Parameters List，找到 RATE_RLL_FF，初始设置为约 0.020。对 "
"RATE_PIT_FF "
"做同样的设置。保存后进行试飞。您现在应该会发现飞行改善很多，控制更好，悬停更稳。稍微调整这些数值，始终记得将参数\"写入\"APM。对于 450 "
"级直升机，尝试横滚用 0.040，俯仰用 0.050。目前还不清楚这些值能推到多高，但最终会开始振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:107
#: ae4b256c880c4cf1b6cdf8457433c798
msgid ""
"Here’s a question that might come up as you begin to fly more: It it’s a "
"little windy and I do not have enough control over the swash, what can I do?"
msgstr "随着您开始飞行更多，可能会出现这样的问题：有点风，我对倾斜盘的控制不够，该怎么办？"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:111
#: 478990fdf4734340b6df345e8aeb897e
msgid ""
"Increase STB_RLL_P from, say, 3.8 to 4.5 is probably a step in the right "
"direction... sort of. It will make the heli try to make bulk moves more "
"strongly, which is good for fighting winds but maybe not so good for camera "
"work as it could jerk the camera around. It does indirectly increase the "
"servo movement."
msgstr ""
"将 STB_RLL_P 从例如 3.8 增加到 4.5 "
"可能是正确方向……某种程度上。这将使直升机更有力地做出大动作，有助于对抗风，但可能不利于摄影，因为会导致相机抖动。它间接地增加了舵机行程。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:117
#: c13ceabf8798439185d54b37909ca74c
msgid ""
"Yes, increasing your RATE_RLL_P will cause it to shake. That's not a great "
"solution. Fill your plate with RATE_RLL_FF? This gives you much more control"
" authority with less chance of shake you get with P-term. It can still crop "
"up however."
msgstr ""
"是的，增加 RATE_RLL_P 会导致颤抖，这不是一个好方案。增大 RATE_RLL_FF 呢？这给您带来更多的控制权限，且出现 P "
"项带来的颤抖的可能性更小，但仍然可能出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:122
#: 33e6ca8b272d4846993f517312878126
msgid ""
"RATE_RLL_I and I_MAX are also important. You should be able to increase I "
"and get more travel without getting the shakes."
msgstr "RATE_RLL_I 和 I_MAX 也很重要。您应该能够增大 I 值，获得更多行程而不产生颤抖。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:125
#: 869412eac6d34711b42a174273b05099
msgid ""
"Moving the control link out on the servo horn will have the exact same "
"effect as increasing the PID terms, so it's not a solution. You'll find you "
"just have to back off the rate PID's to avoid shake again. And then you can "
"get into a situation where you don't have enough resolution on the servo."
msgstr ""
"将控制连杆移到舵机臂外端的效果与增大 PID 参数完全相同，因此不是解决方案。您会发现只需再次降低速率 PID "
"以避免颤抖，然后可能陷入舵机分辨率不足的困境。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:131
#: 83ec2090af37472f885c1f5be0c98967
#, python-format
msgid ""
"One part of this situation is the fact that the Rate I term is not a classic"
" I-term, but a \"leaky\" I term. It bleeds down 2% every 100ms... it's "
"complicated but it's there for a few reasons. One of these reasons is "
"because if we use a standard I-term, and you leave your heli sitting on off-"
"level ground, the swash will slowly tip over as the I-term builds up. If you"
" spool up, the heli will tip over. It's not fun. The problem with this is it"
" really limits how much control movement we can get out of the I-term. It's "
"sort of a lesser of two evils. If we could use a regular I-term, it would "
"help. But we can't... well, we’re working on something but it will only work"
" if you are using the Ch8 rotor speed controller so make sure you have this "
"set up properly."
msgstr ""
"这种情况的一个原因是速率 I 项不是经典的 I 项，而是\"泄漏型\"I 项。它每 100ms 泄漏 "
"2%……这很复杂，但这样设计有几个原因。其中一个原因是，如果我们使用标准 I 项，而您将直升机放在不平的地面上，随着 I "
"项积累，倾斜盘会慢慢倾斜。如果启动旋翼，直升机会翻倒，这很麻烦。这样设计的问题是它确实限制了我们能从 I "
"项获得的控制行程，这是两害相权取其轻。如果我们能使用常规 I 项会有帮助，但目前不行……我们正在开发一个方案，但只有在使用 Ch8 "
"旋翼转速控制器的情况下才有效，所以请确保正确设置了这一项。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:144
#: 175aa7effa7947b68c74d52a2347291b
msgid "Rudder Tuning"
msgstr "方向舵调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:146
#: 6537e6ae3efd40de82fc9cf47c6797e1
msgid ""
"At the same time, think about adding some RATE_YAW_FF. Maybe try using 0.040"
" here. You might expect to back-off on the RATE_YAW_P just a bit as "
"RATE_YAW_FF increases. Start with a RATE_YAW_P value of 0.25 (default) and "
"move downward to say P=0.120 or even P=0.100. Try I = 0.02 and D = 0.002"
msgstr ""
"同时，考虑添加一些 RATE_YAW_FF，例如尝试使用 0.040。随着 RATE_YAW_FF 增大，您可能需要稍微降低 RATE_YAW_P。从 "
"RATE_YAW_P 的默认值 0.25 开始，向下调整到约 P=0.120 甚至 P=0.100。尝试 I = 0.02 和 D = 0.002"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:152
#: dc429848c0c64f09b156e0c35786c07d
msgid "For a 600 size heli the rudder (yaw) settings may look like this:"
msgstr "对于 600 级直升机，方向舵（偏航）设置可能如下："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:155
#: 7d19d902817e43bea9c4be0b0f04bdd7
msgid "RATE_YAW_D"
msgstr "RATE_YAW_D"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:155
#: a2ddfee372b14363a24b7d574fb556f3
msgid "0.004"
msgstr "0.004"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:157
#: 856068304ee14f79a1c80eea9108d8ed
msgid "RATE_YAW_FF"
msgstr "RATE_YAW_FF"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:157
#: 4c94446f937f48d8b752d8c53af66ade
msgid "0.05"
msgstr "0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:159
#: 231e10848a9b42bf94b7f7e3f0072581
msgid "RATE_YAW_I"
msgstr "RATE_YAW_I"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:159
#: 5a491b25b4fd43f6870246a0f4811dfc
msgid "0.15"
msgstr "0.15"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:161
#: 49cd1d99fcc843198777aa860d6b69c1
