msgstr "0.38"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:166
#: 4fe1e4d2af3442fd958adbd99a5733a6
msgid ""
"You’re not finished fiddling with this yet but what you will find is that "
"these settings make the yaw control much stronger then on previous versions "
"of the software and also help reduce the very small oscillation it used to "
"have."
msgstr "您还没有完成对此的调整，但您会发现这些设置使偏航控制比以前版本的软件更加有力，并有助于减少以前存在的非常小的振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:172
#: f0777d5b81dc4e209f778b2373d9d876
msgid "Acro Mode Tuning"
msgstr "Acro 模式调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:174
#: dfe5505bf1534968bab504532c6a65ba
msgid ""
"The AXIS_ENABLE parameter should be set to 1 otherwise Acro mode will be "
"unflyable. AXIS_ENABLE basically turns on a 3-D \"heading lock\" gyro mode "
"that works very well."
msgstr ""
"AXIS_ENABLE 参数应设置为 1，否则 Acro 模式将无法飞行。AXIS_ENABLE 基本上开启了一种 "
"3D\"航向锁定\"陀螺模式，效果非常好。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:178
#: 1787d43f2df64b7eb8bc6718e0457237
msgid "There are a few other parameters you should know about:"
msgstr "还有一些其他参数您需要了解："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:180
#: 3f929a01f5fe4005a73f1df7a370f1f8
msgid ""
"ACRO_BAL_PITCH and ACRO_BAL_ROLL: These create a \"virtual dihedral\" which "
"attempts to return the heli to level. This is what Leonard calls \"Acro with"
" training wheels\". 200 makes it feel almost like stabilize. If you fly with"
" it on 50 it feels nice. 0 would obviously turn it off completely."
msgstr ""
"ACRO_BAL_PITCH 和 ACRO_BAL_ROLL：这些创建了一种\"虚拟上反角\"效果，尝试将直升机恢复到水平。这就是 Leonard "
"所说的\"带辅助轮的 Acro\"。200 使其感觉几乎像 Stabilize，设置为 50 感觉不错，0 则完全关闭此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:186
#: aa746065d3874c5ea7f0300060f0e657
msgid ""
"ACRO_TRAINER: This is in addition to ACRO_BAL_ROLL and prevents the heli "
"from rolling past 45°. You can push it a bit beyond but it won't go too far."
" If you don’t want it, just turn it off."
msgstr ""
"ACRO_TRAINER：这是 ACRO_BAL_ROLL 之外的额外功能，防止直升机横滚超过 "
"45°。您可以稍微超过，但不会偏转太多。如果不需要，直接关闭即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:190
#: bc5cd80d01824de3ad425e7d64968f5f
msgid ""
"If you want to speed up the angular rate, you will want to play with ACRO_P "
"which defaults to 4.5 which gives you a rate of 202°/s. Set at 6 will give "
"about 270°/s and 8 will give about 360°/s. The gyros have a full scale of "
"2,000°/s"
msgstr ""
"如果您想加快角速率，可以调整 ACRO_P，默认值为 4.5，对应 202°/s 的速率。设为 6 大约给出 270°/s，设为 8 大约给出 "
"360°/s。陀螺仪的满量程为 2000°/s"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:196
#: 4474e0efc998407494446fbbbe63a63a
msgid "Stabilization Mode Tuning"
msgstr "Stabilize 模式调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:198
#: 2889ab3d46e64edc8148ef2636726e9c
msgid ""
"One of the things you should look at is your STAB_PIT_P and STAB_RLL_P "
"numbers? These were probably quite low in version 2.7.3, probably less than "
"1, and they should now be 3.5 to 4.5. This is a really big factor in getting"
" the servo movement you are expecting."
msgstr ""
"您应该关注的一个方面是您的 STAB_PIT_P 和 STAB_RLL_P 数值。这些值在 2.7.3 版本中可能相当低，可能低于 1，而现在它们应该在"
" 3.5 到 4.5 之间。这对于获得您期望的舵机行程是非常重要的因素。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:204
#: 35f26c176e974a8e8966d1e075d9790b
msgid "Throttle Tuning"
msgstr "油门调参"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:206
#: 3426d972a52a4b9b9938325d3f1faf6e
msgid ""
"THR_MID convert's the pilot's throttle input (0~1000) to the motor output "
"(130~1000). It has two different scales so that the pilot's 0~500 input maps"
" to the 130~THR_MID value...then another scale so pilot's 501~1000 input is "
"mapped to the THR_MID~1000 output for the motor."
msgstr ""
"THR_MID 将飞手的油门输入（0~1000）转换为电机输出（130~1000）。它有两个不同的比例尺：飞手的 0~500 输入映射到 "
"130~THR_MID 值，另一个比例尺将飞手的 501~1000 输入映射到 THR_MID~1000 的电机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:211
#: 456b05a12e594994b6030c166387dd02
msgid "Essentially THR_MID should be the throttle setting for hover."
msgstr "本质上，THR_MID 应该是悬停时的油门设置。"

