#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:246
#: fd3cbadc57c9420daad25e367b428ca5
msgid "Aerobatics in Acro Mode"
msgstr "Acro 模式特技飞行"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:248
#: decfa9f425284764827391b2b540a305
msgid ""
"Acro Mode in APM:Copter now supports full acrobatic flight!  The function is"
" similar to any other acrobatic FBL controller available on the market.  The"
" performance might not be suitable for helicopter competition, but it "
"certainly adequate for sport flying."
msgstr ""
"APM:Copter 的 Acro 模式现在支持完整的特技飞行！其功能类似于市场上任何其他特技 FBL "
"控制器。性能可能不适合直升机竞赛，但对于运动飞行来说绝对足够。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:253
#: 2bc6dcf6f03a47c59bc82fc31ff6d5a8
msgid ""
"Many maneuvers have been fully tested, loops, rolls, inverted flight, etc.  "
"Caution should be exercised if aggressive 3D type maneuvers are attempted, "
"such as tic-tocs, etc.  While the control algorithms are fine, it's unproven"
" if the system is able to maintain its orientation relative the ground.  In "
"other FBL controllers, if this were to happen, the controller would simply "
"turn off the self-leveling function but the acrobatic flight can continue as"
" normal.  But with APM:Copter, this could lead to loss of control even in "
"Acro mode. We will attempt to remedy this situation in the future so that "
"all maneuvers can be performed."
msgstr ""
"许多机动动作已经过完整测试，包括筋斗、横滚、倒飞等。如果尝试高难度的 3D 类动作（如 tic-toc "
"等），应格外谨慎。虽然控制算法没有问题，但系统是否能够保持相对地面的方向定向尚未得到验证。在其他 FBL "
"控制器中，如果发生这种情况，控制器会简单地关闭自我调平功能，但特技飞行可以继续正常进行。但在 APM:Copter 中，这可能导致即使在 Acro "
"模式下也失去控制。我们将在未来尝试解决这个问题，以便所有机动动作都能正常执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:264
#: d871ae6afb2c4339acabf7dc236094e9
msgid "ACRO_BAL_PITCH = 50"
msgstr "ACRO_BAL_PITCH = 50"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:266
#: c2829f9b33ba4076bd7b8b66ae2586a6
msgid "ACRO_BAL_ROLL = 50"
msgstr "ACRO_BAL_ROLL = 50"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:268
#: 771588b915724ec596aeaf426eeae4af
msgid "ACRO_P = 4.5"
msgstr "ACRO_P = 4.5"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:270
#: 0e6299479a6e4e9d8dddd83711c3e91d
msgid "ACRO_TRAINER = 0"
msgstr "ACRO_TRAINER = 0"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:273
#: dde05f5f01254563aca38c9e53157ba3
msgid "AXIS_ENABLE = 1"
msgstr "AXIS_ENABLE = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:275
#: 833d128d8b744a2c82309141fecc1062
msgid ""
"ACRO_P is basically the angular rate. 4.5 gives you 202.5°/s. 9 would give "
"you 405. But nobody has pushed that high."
msgstr "ACRO_P 基本上就是角速率，4.5 给出 202.5°/s，9 给出 405°/s，但没有人推到那么高。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:278
#: bbd270dc929245ca8fe0778604c05421
msgid ""
"ACRO_BAL_ROLL is like a faked \"dihedral\" effect. It makes the copter "
"return to level gently at center stick. 50 is fairly low, 200 makes it feel "
"almost like Stabilize."
msgstr "ACRO_BAL_ROLL 类似于模拟的\"上反角\"效果，使飞机在中杆时缓慢恢复水平。50 相当低，200 感觉几乎像 Stabilize。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:282
#: a0eeb4a6ed8346c996b909cd307145cf
msgid ""
"ACRO_TRAINER is an addition thing that makes the heli not want to roll past "
"45°."
msgstr "ACRO_TRAINER 是一个额外功能，使直升机不超过 45° 横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-archived-tuning.rst:285
#: a7e02d4243a547ad927b999a1642009b
msgid ""
"AXIS_ENABLE turns the whole angle-lock thing on. Sort of like Futaba AVCS in"
" all 3 axes. Without it, it's pure rate control and your experience will be "
"pretty bad."
msgstr ""
"AXIS_ENABLE 开启整个角度锁定功能，类似于 Futaba AVCS 在所有 3 个轴上的效果。没有它，则是纯速率控制，体验会相当糟糕。"
